  "sentences": [
   "Protected under International Patent Application No. PCT/AU2023/050224.",
   "Dual-sensor approach: infrared flame detection aligned with rate-of-rise temperature monitoring in each zone — fast, accurate, reliable.",
   "Up to four modules covering engine bay, cabin, and EV battery zones independently. Normal Mode or Race Mode activation for precise control.",
   "SS316 nozzles with 120° full-cone spray pattern. Sensor field-of-view aligned with spray cones for synchronised detection and suppression.",
   "Real-time alerts via app, SMS, and email. OTA firmware updates. API for fleet integration. Manage multiple vehicles from a single dashboard.",
   "Conformal-coated PCB, automotive-grade connectors, and IP67-rated electronics — engineered to survive vehicle vibration, heat, and moisture.",
   "SS316 pressure vessel. Refillable with approved water-based fluid — no re-certification required when refill procedure is followed. Annual inspection schedule.",
   "IR flame and rate-of-rise temperature sensors in each zone continuously monitor for fire threats — from engine bays to EV battery compartments."
  ]
